au</surname><given-names>GE</given-names></name><name><surname>Nguyen</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Rihet</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Gene expression analysis reveals early changes in several molecular pathways in cerebral malaria-susceptible mice versus cerebral malaria-resistant mice</article-title><source>BMC Genomics</source><year>2007</year><volume>8</volume><fpage>452</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18062806</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1186/1471-2164-8-452</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B21"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Liang</surname><given-names>CP</given-names></name><name><surname>Tall</surname><given-names>AR</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Transcriptional profiling reveals global defects in energy metabolism, lipoprotein, and bile acid synthesis and transport with reversal by leptin treatment in ob/ob mouse liver</article-title><source>J Biol Chem</source><year>2001</year><volume>276</volume><fpage>49066</fpage><lpage>49076</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11551957</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1074/jbc.M107250200</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B22"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Lan</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Rabaglia</surname><given-names>ME</given-names></name><name><surname>Stoehr</surname><given-names>JP</given-names></name><name><surname>Nadler</surname><given-names>ST</given-names></name><name><surname>Schueler</surname><given-names>KL</given-names></name><name><surname>Zou</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Yandell</surname><given-names>BS</given-names></name><name><surname>Attie</surname><given-names>AD</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Gene expression profiles of nondiabetic and diabetic obese mice suggest a role of hepatic lipogenic capaci